| MismatchedEndIdentifier        | error    |
| UnclosedBlock                  | error    |
| EmptyOutlineSpan               | error    |
| CardReferenceOutsideCards      | warning  |
| RoundTripOutlineChanged        | error    |
| ImportAfterCode                | error    |
| ParseError                     | error    |
| InvalidUnitHeader              | error    |
| UnexpectedStatement            | error    |
| DuplicateDeclaration           | error    |
| MissingRequiredMember          | error    |
| UnknownPropertyOrColumn        | error    |
| InvalidValueLiteral            | error    |
| MalformedTable                 | error    |
| ScopeMismatch                  | error    |
| UnresolvedImportOrReference    | error    |
| TypeMismatch                   | error    |
| UnclosedToken                  | error    |
| UnexpectedToken                | error    |
| report.header_title            | info     |
| diagram.preset_not_found       | warning  |
| filter.unused                  | warning  |
| card.fill_height_default       | info     |
| tab.label                      | info     |
| card.chrome_title              | info     |
| diagram.chart_chrome           | warning  |
| diagram.series_transform       | warning  |
| tab.card_placement             | warning  |
| flow.unfiltered                | warning  |
| diagram.column_not_in_type     | warning  |
| bundle.renderer_missing        | warning  |
| filter.grain_default_missing   | warning  |

end registry
